<title>UK: UK net consumer credit 1.027 bln stg in July.</title>
<headline>UK net consumer credit 1.027 bln stg in July.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England released the following seasonally adjusted consumer credit data -</p>
<p>NET LENDING (previously released data in brackets, in MLN STG)</p>
<p>					     JULY    JUNE	    JULY,95</p>
<p> Total net lending		     2,546   2,054 (2,012)  1,525</p>
<p>  -- Consumer credit		   1,027     659  (636)     629</p>
<p>  -- Secured on dwellings	    1,519   1,395 (1,377)    896</p>
<p>BREAKDOWN of net consumer lending BY SOURCE -</p>
<p>  -- Banks				 835    265    (255)    518</p>
<p>  -- Building societies		 49     30    (29)	14</p>
<p>  -- Other specialist lenders	152    380    (368)     89</p>
<p>  -- Retailers			    -5    -13    (-13)	8</p>
<p>  -- Insurance companies		-4     -3     (-3)    unch</p>
<p>  -- Credit card			 266    180    (183)    146</p>
<p>CONSUMER CREDIT (seasonally adjusted, in PCT)</p>
<p> Total personal borrowing mth/mth  0.5    0.4  (0.4)	0.3</p>
<p>   &quot;	 &quot;    3 mth annualised   6.2    6.0  (5.9)	4.9</p>
<p>   &quot;	 &quot;    6 mth annualised   6.0    5.7  (5.6)	5.2</p>
<p>   &quot;	 &quot;	  &quot;     yr/yr    5.6    5.4  (5.4)	5.7</p>
<p> Consumer credit mth/mth	     1.5    1.0  (0.9)	1.0</p>
<p>   &quot;	 &quot;    3 mth annualised  15.1   15.7  (15.3)    13.4</p>
<p>   &quot;	 &quot;    6 mth annualised  15.8   14.4  (14.1)    12.3</p>
<p>   &quot;	 &quot;    yr/yr		 14.8   14.3  (14.3)    12.9</p>
<p> Secured on dwellings mth/mth	0.4    0.4  (0.3)	0.2</p>
<p>   &quot;	 &quot;    3 mth annualised   4.7    4.4  (4.4)	3.6</p>
<p>   &quot;	 &quot;    6 mth annualised   4.4    4.3   (4.3)    4.1</p>
<p>   &quot;	 &quot;    yr/yr		  4.2    4.0   (4.0)    4.6</p>
<p>-- Michael Peacock, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
